{
  "sourceFile": "Книга Взводу Охорони — робоча.xlsx",
  "notes": {
    "personnelCallsign": "Column P Callsign holds working callsign values (e.g. ГРАФ); column L is RNTRC; column M is Driver's license; column N is Email; column O is Weapon (summary text); no TEMPLATE column in reference file.",
    "personnelStatus": "Status is column T (20). Self-heal prefers T when the header is missing.",
    "month06": "Compact layout: A=BR formula, B=Позивний, dates from C, notes in AH. Sheets 07-11 use the same compact geometry; 09 and 11 stop one column earlier because those months have 30 days.",
    "monthStandard": "Sheets 02-05: A=ТЕЛЕФОН, B=ПОЗИВНИЙ, dates from H. Sheet 02 uses shortened identity headers. Sheets 03-05 use ПОСАДА, ОШС 4 and Особовий склад ПІБ. Sheet 05 keeps Примітки after the last date.",
    "dict": "Working-book DICT row 1 leaves A and B blank. From row 2, A and B mirror DICT_SUM code and service label; C is Місце and D is Завдання. Readers fall back to columns A and B when those headers are blank. Materialize copies DICT_SUM A:B and keeps C:D.",
    "dictSum": "DICT_SUM Code / Type of service / Order is the summary source of truth, including Копачі, ДСК, ВЛК відпустка and Н/З. Legacy schedule spellings Black, DC and Евак. fold into the canonical codes.",
    "expenseBk": "Expense_BK is the ammunition expenditure log: Date, Crew, Name, Number.",
    "aircraftSerials": "SN_AIRCRAFT groups airframes by model. Row 1 holds the model name in the first column of each group; the next column is the board number; serials start at row 2.",
    "phoneDirectory": "PHONE_DIRECTORY is a sectioned reference without a required header row: column A holds section titles (often merged A:B) or phone numbers, column B holds contact name/description. Optional English headers Phone / Section + Name / Note are still accepted by the parser.",
    "car": "CAR is an optional vehicle register from the real workbook: A=Callsign, B=Name of military property, C=Military registration number, D=Chassis number, E=Year of manufacture, F=Value, G=Condition, H=Callsign (legacy when A=FML). Linked to PERSONNEL by Callsign (or legacy FML); ownerDriversLicense is read from PERSONNEL Driver's license. Legacy A=FML is read only for compatibility.",
    "month07": "Compact layout: B=Позивний, dates from C, notes in AH.",
    "weapon": "WEAPON is a person-bound military property register: A:E person identity; property blocks F:L and N:T with empty separator columns M and U. The working book already has helper Callsign at AA. materializeWeaponOwnersFromPersonnel_ refreshes A:E from PERSONNEL and keeps that Callsign column.",
    "dictSum": "DICT_SUM in the working book has Code / Type of service / Order only (no Резерв column).",
    "temporaryProperty": "Property_issued_for_temporary_u is the temporary issue/return register (may be created by apiSetupTemporaryPropertyRegister when absent). PROPERTY_CATALOG drives dependent dropdowns and units; PROPERTY_KITS defines automatic component rows."
  },
